{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal baseline combining RNA data encoded with pca_n2000 and image data encoded with resnet50, using simple concatenation fusion and no aggregation. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate performance, but no direct comparison to single-modality baselines exists. The role of encoder choices and fusion strategy remains uncertain without additional comparative experiments."
}

